                                        <string key="text">Welcome to Fully Noded!
 
Thanks for giving the app a try. In order to use it you need to connect a node. Designed to work with Bitcoin Core, Bitcoin Knots and any other Bitcoin client that mirrors Bitcoin Core's RPC API.

Just go to Settings &gt; Node Manager and tap the + button to add a node.

For more information please visit our website at fullynoded.app.

If you are using a node package such as NODL, MyNode, Start 9, Umbrel, RaspiBlitz, Fully Noded Server or BTC Pay Server they all support Fully Noded's Quick Connect QR.</string>
